                                                "example_id": "5a3e206f-fb88-49e1-a756-df555aa1e23b",
                                                "sense_id": "cf333c98-ea84-3f78-98a1-d2bb7e7dbcf8",
                                                "text": "[…] the director of Wallace Shawn's Aunt Dan and Lemon replaces the characters' intellectual and verbal energy with \"transparent rationalizations for the personal hang-ups of the characters […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
